  "description": "Deep-space nebula of domain-warped plasma clouds coloured by the Hydrogen Balmer series: H-alpha dominates the core, H-beta fills mid regions, bass drives the ionization front and shockwave rings, treble adds sparkles. Domain Chaos twists and shears each warp octave into gas filaments; Warp Amount scales the domain-warp lens, and holding the pointer coils it into a swirling gravity well that seeds new star formation. Dark photoevaporation pillars point at the core, their eroded tips lit by bright ionised rims.",
